      "description": "修订响应.xlsx 恰好覆盖 12 条真实审阅意见，目标页、状态和 PPT 实际结果一致，不含额外无来源断言。",
      "weight": 6,
      "type": "hurdle",
      "dimension": "factuality",
      "method": "deterministic",
      "method_params": {"requirement_count": 12, "reject_unsupported_assertions": true},
